{"seq":7,"trial_id":"m3-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T05:13:32.808Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b2646288b8c1bf15261deb17f32477852d55e6b1c1a4bd80495e2a76148dd6b9","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Nadia, Gideon said \"Both lanes working as of Aug 3, 11:07\" in a message posted at 11:08 AM. The channel doesn't state a time zone, so I can't say which one 11:07 is in. The first check-in once kiosk 1 came back was trailer 8836. Mateo reported it at 11:03 AM: \"Kiosk 1 is back. Guard checked in trailer 8836; dispatch sees it.\" The related ticket is INC-4821, which covers the status-page access issue.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
